`]}),e.jsxs(n,{title:"Linear attention, derived from softmax attention",children:[e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["If each layer may keep only a fixed amount of memory, what should it keep? Several answers are reasonable, and each leads to a mechanism. A running sum or average of the past leads to linear attention's state, derived below. Keeping the last ",e.jsx(a,{math:"W",display:!1})," tokens is Week 4's sliding window. Keeping a few anchor tokens is Week 4's attention sinks. Storing a smaller entry per token is Week 4's multi-head latent attention (MLA), whose cache is smaller but still grows with the context. Dropping the least-used entries is cache eviction, which Week 10 covers."]}),e.jsx(t.h4,{children:"Softmax attention as a weighted sum"}),e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Take one head of Week 2's causal attention. Position ",e.jsx(a,{math:"t",display:!1})," has a query ",e.jsx(a,{math:"q_t \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d_k}",display:!1,trail:","})," and each position ",e.jsx(a,{math:"j",display:!1})," has a key ",e.jsx(a,{math:"k_j \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d_k}",display:!1})," and a value ",e.jsx(a,{math:"v_j \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d_v}",display:!1,trail:"."})," In this note the output ",e.jsx(a,{math:"y_t",display:!1})," is a row vector of width ",e.jsx(a,{math:"d_v",display:!1,trail:"."})," For one query, softmax attention is a weighted average of the values:"]}),e.jsx(a,{math:"y_t = \\frac{\\sum_{j \\le t} \\exp\\!\\big(q_t^\\top k_j / \\sqrt{d_k}\\big)\\, v_j^\\top}{\\sum_{j \\le t} \\exp\\!\\big(q_t^\\top k_j / \\sqrt{d_k}\\big)}. \\tag{1}"}),e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["This is a definition: row ",e.jsx(a,{math:"t",display:!1})," of Week 2's attention formula under the causal mask. The weight of key ",e.jsx(a,{math:"j",display:!1})," is a similarity between ",e.jsx(a,{math:"q_t",display:!1})," and ",e.jsx(a,{math:"k_j",display:!1,trail:","})," divided by the sum of all the similarities so that the weights add up to one. Formula (1) computes a new weight for every pair of positions, and that is where the ",e.jsx(a,{math:"L^2",display:!1})," comes from."]}),e.jsx(t.h4,{children:"Assumptions"}),e.jsxs(t.ul,{children:[`
