`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:["Kimi Linear combines Kimi Delta Attention (KDA) with multi-head latent attention (MLA) at 3:1 and uses no positional encoding (NoPE) on its MLA layers. Against its MLA baseline it reports up to about 6 times the decode throughput and 75% less KV cache at 1M context ",e.jsx(i,{id:"kimi2025kimilinear",children:"Kimi Team, 2025"}),"."]}),`
